<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Movement increases.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Movement increases.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat bids were weaker Thursday at both interior and export locations as grain dealers reported a pickup in movement.</p>
<p>&quot;A lot of elevators are telling me that they've bought more wheat in the last two or three days than they have in several months,&quot; a Montana grain merchandiser said.</p>
<p>Dealers said movement had increased because farmers were taking advantage of a recent upswing in prices to sell some wheat. One dealer also said some producers needed &quot;a little extra Christmas money.&quot;  </p>
